    "description": "Views of the ocean! Coastal living at its finest in the vibrant Richmond District, right on Geary Boulevard for easy transportation access. Just a few blocks from the ocean, this prime location offers the perfect blend of city convenience and seaside tranquility. Walk to Golden Gate Park & Sutro Baths Point, and enjoy the beautifully remodeled property that combines old-world charm with modern comforts. An excellent investment opportunity, this property is perfect for an owner-occupier looking to generate income while enjoying the perks of living in the city by the sea. The property features 3 units, each separately metered. PLUS a bonus studio .There are 2 vacant units: the first is a spacious 3-bedroom, 2-bath layout w/inside laundry, an inviting breakfast nook, and an open living room designed to capture breathtaking ocean views and the other is a bonus studio apartment, ideal for rental income or visiting guests. Additionally, there are two occupied units, each offering 2 bedrooms and 1 bath, providing a steady rental income opportunity. Garage parking, plenty of storage, coin laundry for additional units, & ample parking within the building, convenience is at your doorstep. One of San Francisco's most desirable neighborhoods."
  },
